# Copy to .env.local and adjust:   cp .env.example .env.local
# .env files are git-ignored. Vite reads VITE_* variables when it BUILDS the app, so changing one
# needs `npm run dev` to be restarted or `npm run build` to be run again.

# Where the SPHEREx backend lives.
#  - Local development: leave it empty. The dev server forwards /api and /static to
#    http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts).
#  - Production: the public URL of the backend, with no trailing slash. The backend sends absolute
#    image URLs (it needs its own PUBLIC_BASE set), and the browser calls this address directly.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Development only: another backend for the dev-server proxy (not read by the built app).
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:8001
